<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav September retail sales rise four percent.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav September retail sales rise four percent.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES     SEPT 96	AUG 96	 SEPT 95</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	   + 4.0	 + 7.0	     n.a.</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    + 90	 + 100		 n.a.</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO SEPT)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	   + 102	 + 103	     n.a.</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude private sector. Data cover rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
